# Project skills

Shared skills (writing style, citations, figures, tables, diagrams,
preview review, ...) ship with trazo and update with it. Add a folder
here with a `SKILL.md` only for a skill specific to this project; a folder
with the same name as a trazo skill replaces it. Then run
`scripts/trazo agents` to regenerate
`.agents/skills/` and `.claude/skills/`.
